# Restora – Frontend Overview

This repo is **Restora** (Restaurant Management System) **client only**.
Keep it separate from `RestaurentManagement-server`. Do not put Express, Mongoose, or server secrets here.

## Stack

- React.js, Next.js App Router, JavaScript (ES6+) only, Tailwind CSS
- Never create `.ts`, `.tsx`, or `tsconfig.json`
- Add Socket.IO client, Zod, Cloudinary uploads, Recharts, or payments only when a feature needs them

## Architecture

- UI and client-side composition live here
- Business logic, authorization, and persistence live on the backend
- Talk to the API over REST (`/api/v1/...`); never trust frontend role checks as security
- Work incrementally; do not generate the whole app in one pass
- Do not overwrite working code

## UI modules (surfaces, not server logic)

Admin/staff dashboards, customers, food/categories, tables, orders, kitchen, billing/payments, reservations, inventory, reviews, notifications, sales analytics.
